            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Urban contends that the McCarran\u2011Ferguson Act provides a Dormant Commerce Clause exemption for state\u2011regulated milk pricing."
