            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Urban, he also asserts that California\u2019s Section\u202f7254 creates an exemption for the state\u2019s milk pooling and pricing laws."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Urban",
        "citations": [
          {
